[32m[00:29:15.796][0m [Core] [1m[INFO][0m [runners.tool_loop_agent_runner:1360]: [1mTool `web_search_tavily` Result: {"results": [{"title": "Most Visited Websites in the World - Updated July 2026 | Exploding Topics", "url": "https://analytics.explodingtopics.com/website", "snippet": "As of July 2026, google.com is the most visited website globally, attracting 105.8B monthly visits. youtube.com follows with 57.1B visits, and facebook.com records 10.3B visits.\n In terms of user engagement, instagram.com leads with 10.03 pages per visit.\n pornhub.com has the lowest bounce rate at 23.97%. weather.com has the highest at 74.91%.\n chatgpt.com holds the #5 position with 6.1B visits.\n xhamster.com rounds out the top 20 with 1.7B visits and a 29.76% bounce rate. [...] Our website rankings combine multiple data points: total monthly visits, engagement metrics, and growth rates. Rankings are updated monthly using Semrush's analysis of 200M+ users' browsing patterns for accuracy.\n\nWhat is the top website in the World?\n\nCurrently google.com is the most visited website in the World. In July 2026 it had 105.8B monthly visits.\n\nWhat are the top 10 websites in the World?\n\nThe top 10 websites in the World are: [...] 1. 1. google.com\n2. 2. youtube.com\n3. 3. facebook.com\n4. 4. instagram.com\n5. 5. chatgpt.com\n6. 6. reddit.com\n7. 7. wikipedia.org\n8. 8. x.com\n9. 9. pornhub.com\n10. 10. whatsapp.com\n\nHow accurate is this traffic data?\n\nThis data comes from Semrush's analysis of 200M+ anonymized users' browsing patterns, making it one of the most comprehensive traffic intelligence sources available. While no third-party data is 100% precise, these rankings accurately reflect relative market positions.", "index": "70f9.1"}, {"title": "Most Visited Websites in the World July 2026 | Top ...", "url": "https://www.semrush.com/trending-websites/global/all", "snippet": "As of June 2026, google.com leads  in the World with 98.19B monthly visits. Its audience skews mobile-first (28.8% desktop / 28.8% mobile), and traffic is down month over month -2.95% and up year over year 0.08%. youtube.com holds second with 52.22B visits and a mobile-leaning mix (31.52% desktop / 68.48% mobile), while facebook.com ranks third with 9.1B visits. [...] Across the leaders, vietnam.vn is the most mobile-first (98.95% of visits), whereas atlassian.net is the most desktop-reliant (97.19%). Momentum favors futbol-libres.su in the latest month (431,190,850%), while shein.com shows the steepest pullback.\n\nAcquisition patterns also differ: google.com is driven primarily by search, google.com by direct, and google.com by referral; overall, 92 of the top 100 sites are direct-led, 8 are search-led, and 0 lean on social. [...] ## Most Visited Websites in the World, Updated June 2026\n\ngoogle.com\nyoutube.com\nfacebook.com\ninstagram.com\nchatgpt.com\nreddit.com\nwikipedia.org\nx.com\npornhub.com\nwhatsapp.com\ntiktok.com\namazon.com\nxvideos.com\nyahoo.com\nduckduckgo.com\nbing.com\nyahoo.co.jp\nweather.com\nxhamster.com\nlinkedin.com\n\n### More data. Sharper moves. Faster growth.\n\nLeverage Traffic & Market intelligence to size markets, evaluate competitors, and guide strategic moves.\n\nTraffic Overview\n\n#### Traffic Overview", "index": "70f9.2"}, {"title": "Top Websites Ranking - Most Visited Websites In The World", "url": "https://www.similarweb.com/top-websites", "snippet": "google.com is ranked #1 as the most popular website in the world for July 2026. The average amount of time that users spend on the website is 00:09:58 minutes, and they see, on average, 8.68 pages per visit. Pages per visit is a popular engagement metric that is calculated by dividing the total number of website views by the total number of visitors. The bounce rate for google.com is 28.49%, meaning that 28.49% of visitors leave the website after viewing just one page. In addition to being [...] Number five on our list is chatgpt.com, a top AI Chatbots and Tools website. Visitors see 4.29 pages per visit and spend 00:06:35 minutes on the website. The bounce rate for chatgpt.com is 29.51%.\n\n### FAQs About The Top Websites\n\nQuestion: Which is the most visited website in the world?  \nAnswer: google.com is the most visited website in the world in July 2026. [...] Question: Which is the 2nd most visited website in the world?  \nAnswer: youtube.com is the 2nd most visited website in the world in July 2026.\n\nQuestion: What are the top 5 most popular websites in the world?  \nAnswer: The top 5 most popular websites in the world in July 2026 are:  \n1. google.com  \n2. youtube.com  \n3. facebook.com  \n4. instagram.com  \n5. chatgpt.com.", "index": "70f9.3"}, {"title": "Top 100 Most Visited Websites in the World (August 2026)", "url": "https://backlinko.com/most-popular-websites", "snippet": "| Ranking | Website | Monthly Traffic (Visits) |\n --- \n| 1 | google.com | 111.75 billion |\n| 2 | youtube.com | 54.4 billion |\n| 3 | facebook.com | 10.85 billion |\n| 4 | instagram.com | 7.16 billion |\n| 5 | chatgpt.com | 6.19 billion |\n| 6 | reddit.com | 5.76 billion |\n| 7 | wikipedia.org | 4.87 billion |\n| 8 | x.com | 4.44 billion |\n| 9 | whatsapp.com | 3.06 billion |\n| 10 | yahoo.com | 2.56 billion |\n| 11 | amazon.com | 2.51 billion |\n| 12 | tiktok.com | 2.51 billion | [...] | 65 | amazon.de | 430.94 million |\n| 66 | etsy.com | 411.86 million |\n| 67 | bilibili.com | 409.73 million |\n| 68 | rakuten.co.jp | 397.81 million |\n| 69 | steampowered.com | 386.7 million |\n| 70 | quora.com | 377.26 million |\n| 71 | instructure.com | 372.46 million |\n| 72 | mail.ru | 368.24 million |\n| 73 | shopify.com | 355.45 million |\n| 74 | disneyplus.com | 354.28 million |\n| 75 | amazon.co.uk | 342.45 million |\n| 76 | shein.com | 335.65 million |\n| 77 | theguardian.com | 332.75 million | [...] | 13 | duckduckgo.com | 2.16 billion |\n| 14 | bing.com | 2.15 billion |\n| 15 | yahoo.co.jp | 2.06 billion |\n| 16 | linkedin.com | 1.67 billion |\n| 17 | microsoftonline.com | 1.6 billion |\n| 18 | netflix.com | 1.57 billion |\n| 19 | temu.com | 1.44 billion |\n| 20 | microsoft.com | 1.41 billion |\n| 21 | msn.com | 1.4 billion |\n| 22 | live.com | 1.4 billion |\n| 23 | fandom.com | 1.36 billion |\n| 24 | pinterest.com | 1.36 billion |\n| 25 | weather.com | 1.35 billion |", "index": "70f9.4"}, {"title": "List of most-visited websites - Wikipedia", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_most-visited_websites", "snippet": "As of July 2026,( Google Search is the world's most visited website, followed by YouTube, Facebook, and Instagram.\n\nThis list and its two reference data sources, Similarweb and Semrush, do not account for app traffic, which now constitutes the largest share of overall internet traffic.\n\n## List\n\nThis is a dynamic list and may never be able to satisfy particular standards for completeness. You can help by editing the page to add missing items, with references to reliable sources. [...] | Mail.ru | mail.ru | 39 (Increase)1 | N/A | Email | VK \"VK (company)\") | Russia |\n| Globo | globo.com | 40 (Decrease)1 | 40 | News | Grupo Globo | Brazil |\n| DuckDuckGo | duckduckgo.com | 41 (Increase)1 | 15 (Increase)1 | Search engine | DuckDuckGo | United States |\n| Booking.com | booking.com | 42 (Increase)8 | 50 | Travel agency | Booking Holdings | Netherlands |\n| Stripchat | stripchat.com | 43 (Increase)1 | N/A | Adult camming | Stripchat | Cyprus | [...] | Amazon \"Amazon (company)\") | amazon.com | 15 (Increase)1 | 12 (Decrease) | E-commerce | Amazon Inc. | United States |\n| Gemini \"Gemini (chatbot)\") | gemini.google.com | 16 (Decrease)4 | N/A | Chatbot | Alphabet | United States |\n| LinkedIn | linkedin.com | 17 (Steady) | 19 (Decrease)1 | Social media | Microsoft | United States |\n| Baidu | baidu.com | 18 (Steady) | N/A | Search engine | Baidu | China |\n| Naver | naver.com | 19 (Increase)1 | 34 | News | Naver Corporation | South Korea |", "index": "70f9.5"}, {"title": "Top websites by unique visitors 2026 | Statista", "url": "https://www.statista.com/statistics/1201889/most-visited-websites-worldwide-unique-visits", "snippet": "# Most popular websites worldwide as of February 2026, by unique visitors (in millions)\n\nLeading websites worldwide 2026, by unique visitors\n\nIn February 2026, Google.com was the website with the highest number of unique visitors worldwide, attracting approximately \n5.64\n billion. YouTube.com ranked second, with an estimated \n2.85\n billion unique visitors. Both platforms also held the top positions globally in terms of total website visits.\n\n## Related insights [...] Statista R identifies and awards industry leaders, top providers, and exceptional brands through exclusive rankings and top lists in collaboration with renowned media brands worldwide. For more details, visit our website.\n\nSee why Statista is the trusted choice for reliable data and insights. We provide one platform to simplify research and support your strategic decisions. Learn more\n\nExpert resources to inform and inspire. [...] Consumer Trends 2026\n\nMarket forecast and expert KPIs for 1000+ markets in 190+ countries & territories\n\nInsights on consumer attitudes and behavior worldwide\n\nDetailed information for 39,000+ online stores and marketplaces\n\nFlexible integration for any environment\n\nAI researchers delivering human-verified insights\n\nTrusted data, wherever you work\n\nDirectly accessible data for 170 industries from 150+ countries and over 1 million facts:", "index": "70f9.6"}, {"title": "The World's Most Visited Websites by Time Spent Per Visit", "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/Infographics/comments/1jnd96d/the_worlds_most_visited_websites_by_time_spent", "snippet": "The one that stands out the most is WhatsApp. Pornhub and LinkedIn have high visit durations. Top 10 websites by total visits in September 2025", "index": "70f9.7"}]}[0m
